<div class="main one_column participants">
<div class="title_main_content">
<h1 class="title_main title_id_20" id="title-main">Approved Participants List</h1>
<div class="accessibility_options">
<div class="text_size">
<a href="#" title="Decrease Text Size" class="small-text" id="small-text"><span class="fa fa-font"></span><span class="indice"><span class="fa fa-minus"></span></span></a>
<a href="#" title="Increase Text Size" class="big-text" id="big-text"><span class="fa fa-font"></span><span class="indice"><span class="fa fa-plus"></span></span></a>
</div>
<a href="#" title="Print this page" id="aPrint"><span class="fa fa-print"></span></a>
<div class="clearfixe"></div>
</div>
<div class="clearfixe"></div>
</div>
<div class="fs-text">
<p>To become an approved participant of Bourse de Montr&eacute;al Inc. or for any questions about admission requirements, please consult the <a class="blank external" href="https://reg.m-x.ca/en/approval/approved-participants#overview" target="_blank">Approved Participants</a> section of the Regulatory Division's Approval web page.</p>
<p>For more information on how to access Montr&eacute;al Exchange's markets or about connectivity, please contact our Corporate Relations department at <span class="nowrap">514 871-7878</span> or by email at <a href="mailto:info-mx@tmx.com">info-mx@tmx.com</a>.</p>
<p>The approved participants list is available in <a class="blank csv" href="/files/mx-participants-en.csv" target="_blank">CSV format</a>.</p>
